{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o038a","title":"张郃追至木门中矢卒张雄嗣","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o038a-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"张郃追至木门中矢卒张雄嗣","evidence":["zhangle-e-o038a-q"]},{"id":"zhuge-e-o038a-account","label":"《诸葛亮传第五》正文","text":"诸葛亮出祁山木牛运粮尽退军射杀张郃","evidence":["zhuge-e-o038a-q"]},{"id":"houzhu-a-fb8358416f44","label":"《后主传》正文","text":"夏六月，亮粮尽退军。郃追至青封〖9〗，与亮交战，被箭死〖10〗。","evidence":["houzhu-q-O023"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0183","role":"追击战死","evidence":["zhangle-e-o038a-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0029","role":"嗣爵","evidence":["zhangle-e-o038a-q"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"出军退战","evidence":["zhuge-e-o038a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":231,"label":"诸葛亮复出祁山","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhangle-y231","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhangle-q-o038","basis":"诸葛亮复出祁山"},"evidence":["zhangle-e-o038a-q","zhangle-q-o038","mingdi-q-o021","mingdi-q-b-c8dc64098d12ed2b34ee"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o038a-q","source_order":[17,126,"O038a"],"order":3566}],"persons":[{"id":"zhangle-p0029","name":"张雄","evidence":["zhangle-q-o038"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o038-zhangle-p0029","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o038"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houzhu-q-O023","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-818e8d3f405f496e4d45","layer":"original","quote":"夏六月，亮粮尽退军。郃追至青封〖9〗，与亮交战，被箭死〖10〗。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":55,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-c8dc64098d12ed2b34ee","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-c8dc64098d12ed2b34ee","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗五年：太和五年（公元 231 ）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":167,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-99c1873dc57e954cfdf4","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mingdi-q-o021","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b3a0b254d489f1ed2693","layer":"original","quote":"五年春正月〖1〗，帝耕于籍田。三月，大司马曹真薨。诸葛亮寇天水。诏大将军司马宣王拒之。自去冬十月至此月，不雨。辛巳〖2〗，大雩〖3〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":161,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o038a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-c1063503dbdd30068c78","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮复出祁山，诏郃督诸将西至略阳〖14〗。亮还保祁山，郃追至木门〖15〗；与亮军交战，飞矢中郃右膝，薨。﹝一﹞谥曰壮侯。子雄嗣。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o038","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-c1063503dbdd30068c78","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛亮复出祁山，诏郃督诸将西至略阳〖14〗。亮还保祁山，郃追至木门〖15〗；与亮军交战，飞矢中郃右膝，薨。﹝一﹞谥曰壮侯。子雄嗣。郃前后征伐有功，明帝分郃户，封郃四子列侯；赐小子爵关内侯。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":125,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o038a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-975c90b64c3e4282352a","layer":"original","quote":"九年〖1〗，亮复出祁山，以木牛运，﹝一﹞粮尽退军；与魏将张郃交战，射杀郃。﹝二﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":257,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
